# RGB approximations for the measured diffuse Cornell Box.
# Geometry and spectral reference: Cornell University Program of Computer Graphics
# https://bowers.cornell.edu/computer-graphics/data
# These RGB coefficients are illustrative, not a calibrated spectral conversion.
# Ks=0 gives diffuse materials; Pr is tinyobjloader's roughness extension.

newmtl white
Kd 0.725 0.710 0.680
Ks 0 0 0
Ke 0 0 0
Pr 1
Ni 1.5
illum 1

newmtl red
Kd 0.630 0.065 0.050
Ks 0 0 0
Ke 0 0 0
Pr 1
Ni 1.5
illum 1

newmtl green
Kd 0.140 0.450 0.091
Ks 0 0 0
Ke 0 0 0
Pr 1
Ni 1.5
illum 1

newmtl light
Kd 0.78 0.78 0.78
Ks 0 0 0
Ke 15 12 8
Pr 1
Ni 1.5
illum 1
